1
00:00:03,217 --> 00:00:07,717
In the WidgetsList section of an article, each card has a handle on its left.

2
00:00:07,717 --> 00:00:11,133
Drag a card by its handle to change its order, or to move

3
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:12,597
it into another zone.

4
00:00:13,059 --> 00:00:15,963
The arrow button collapses a card to its header.

5
00:00:15,963 --> 00:00:18,169
Choose it again to expand the card.

6
00:00:18,636 --> 00:00:23,340
Pointing at the header of a card reveals a plus button titled Insert Widget.

7
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:28,616
It opens the same list of widget types and inserts the chosen widget before that card.

8
00:00:29,091 --> 00:00:32,229
The trash button removes a card after you confirm.

9
00:00:32,229 --> 00:00:36,151
Changes to widgets are saved with the article, not on their own.

